:"3d550cb87c34","n":15,"p":[[0,2,"Abaye says:"],[2,3,"one who betroths"],[3,4,"with a loan,"],[4,9,"she is not betrothed. … by … the benefit of the loan, … she is betrothed.","<b>she is not betrothed.</b> The reason is that a woman can be betrothed only through her acceptance of money, or an item that has monetary value, at the time of the betrothal. Although this woman owes the man money, at the time the man states that she is betrothed to him, the loan is not in fact money but an obligation. Therefore, he does not actually give her anything at the time of the betrothal. By contrast, if he betroths her <b>by</b> means of <b>the benefit of the loan,</b><b> she is betrothed.</b>"],[9,12,"But it is prohibited to do so,"],[12,13,"due to"],[13,14,"an artifice … of","<b>an artifice</b> used to circumvent the prohibition <b>of</b>"],[14,15,"interest,"]],"w":{"0":"says","1":"Abaye","2":"one who betroths","3":"with a loan","4":"she is not","5":"betrothed","6":"by … the benefit of the","7":"loan","8":"she is betrothed","9":"But it is prohibited","10":"to do","11":"so","12":"due to","13":"an artifice … of","14":"interest"},"g":[]},{"k":"7432d4f89712","n":18,"p":[[0,1,"What is meant … this","<b>What is meant</b> by <b>this</b>"],[1,5,"The benefit of the loan?"],[5,7,"If we say that … he established … upon it","<b> If we say that</b> it means that <b>he established</b> interest <b>upon it</b>"],[7,9,"he said to her"],[9,10,"four"],[10,11,"in"],[10,11,"five,"],[11,12,"this is"],[12,14,"full-fledged interest,"],[14,16,"And furthermore,"],[16,17,"This is"],[17,18,"a loan,"]],"w":{"0":"What is meant … this","1":"The benefit of the","2":"loan","5":"If we say","6":"that … he established … upon it","7":"he said","8":"to her","9":"four","10":"in … five","11":"this is","12":"interest","13":"full fledged","15":"And furthermore","16":"This is","17":"a loan"},"g":[[0,1,"זו","a"],[2,5,"כיצד היא בדיוק","a"],[5,7,"אם תאמר שזקף, קבע עליה","a"],[11,12,"הרי","a"],[12,15,"מעולה, גמורה, היא","a"],